### REST Client Test File
### Use with REST Client extension in VS Code or similar tools
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@token = your_token_here
@user1_id = user1_id_here
@user2_id = user2_id_here
@image_id = image_id_here

### ============================================
### AUTHENTICATION ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

### Register User 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "password": "AlicePass123!"
}

### Register User 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "bob",
  "password": "BobPass123!"
}

### Login User 1 (Alice)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "password": "AlicePass123!"
}

### Login User 2 (Bob)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "bob",
  "password": "BobPass123!"
}

### ============================================
### USER MANAGEMENT ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

### List All Users (Requires Auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### IMAGE SHARING ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

### Upload Image (Requires Auth)
### Note: Use Postman or similar tool for file uploads
### Form Data:
###   receiver_id: {{user2_id}}
###   file: [select image file]
POST {{baseUrl}}/images/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="receiver_id"

{{user2_id}}
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test_image.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### Get Sent Images (Requires Auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/images/sent
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Received Images (Requires Auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/images/received
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Download Image (Requires Auth - Only Receiver)
GET {{baseUrl}}/images/{{image_id}}/download
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### HEALTH CHECK ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

### Root Endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
